:null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-14T16:12:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T19:52:19Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T19:52:02Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124479","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124479","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124479.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124479.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-14T19:52:01Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\nLine3D has a naming discrepancy with Line2D. Possibly a non-problem.\n\n### Line2D\n\n<img width=\"598\" height=\"446\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9658adc-5984-44e9-a883-c1429af10963\" />\n\n### Line3D\n\n<img width=\"605\" height=\"325\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d41abb6-77cc-48f8-8def-f2da1738a3e1\" />\n\n\n## Additional information\n\nI'm not sure how much we care about 2d and 3d consistency in naming, my instinct tells me we care at least a bit.\n\nLine2D's enums are all preceded by Line<etc> while Line3D aren't. I am not sure what's the naming policy on that, and if the enums should change name to be of the form Line<etc> for example LineMaterialMode instead of MaterialMode.\n\nAdditionally, perhaps tiling mode should change to texture mode as well? It may be more intuitive, but i suspect we'd get users asking \"where do i assign a texture\" if we call it TextureMode instead of tiling mode.\n\nThis change only change the enum names since I think that the 2d ones are a bit more clear than the 3d ones. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124479/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124479/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}